Kovcheg
=======

Kovcheg is a derivative work of torlink — https://github.com/baairon/torlink —
Copyright (c) 2026 bairon.dev, licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

The search side (source adapters, CLI, browser UI) comes from that project.
Kovcheg adds a desktop client (Tauri 2 + Rust), a game library with covers and
playtime, and silent installation of repacks.

Modifications Copyright (c) 2026 Alexander (Domanffe).

